- the gearing/speed can be controlled via:<br>
-- top's mass. larger for slower speeds<br>
-- torquing arm's length. longer for lower speeds.<br>
-- torquing arm's diameter where it touches the ground. smaller for lower speeds.<br>
<br>
that is BTPM<br>
